[I] Copy/paste anything over the network

[T] Piknik seamlessly and securely transfers URLs, code snippets, documents
[T] and virtually anything between arbitrary hosts, like a network
[T] clipboard. No SSH is needed and hosts can sit behind NAT gateways.

[U] https://github.com/jedisct1/piknik

